      "coalesceable": true,
      "authorityNote": "The backend sends this only after current exact relay admission. It is the one piece of session state the backend may author without device authentication, because transport loss is observable only by the backend. It carries no focus flag and no other state: the host may do nothing with it but release clientId from the focus aggregation, so a compromised backend gains no ability it did not already have by dropping the connection. It requires no capability because no participant authored it and it asserts nothing.",
